WEBVTT

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:02.519
that interaction between the students 
among themselves

00:10:02.519 --> 00:10:04.580
and the faculty and the students.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:08.130
Maybe the format will change, 
maybe the way it's going to change,

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:12.425
maybe whether it is all 
at the same time might be changing,

00:10:12.425 --> 00:10:17.450
but I think we are going to envision
a different way of conducting business.

00:10:17.952 --> 00:10:21.572
I think one element that we all 
really need to think about,

00:10:21.572 --> 00:10:23.292
when we talk about this,

00:10:23.292 --> 00:10:28.914
is that accessibility,
inclusiveness is a challenge

00:10:28.914 --> 00:10:33.424
because there are a lot of countries today
that do not have Internet access,